e/godot/issues/104979#issuecomment-2788323150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104979","id":2788323150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mMm9O","user":{"login":"adriano-sudario","id":13634034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjM0MDM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13634034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario","html_url":"https://github.com/adriano-sudario","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriano-sudario/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T05:31:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T05:31:26Z","body":"> Hi [@Natahan-Tatan](https://github.com/Natahan-Tatan)\n> \n> I am checking this issue in master branch.\n> \n> I use same steps as you mentioned above, after that, Godot freeze and I cannot click anything But from the GIF, looks like you can still click the buttons.\n\njust tried to reproduce here as well and it has the same behavior.\nit also freezes if you try to change parameters on the .tres file.\nmaybe there's a problem on the way the script generetes the .tres file? it's hard to know only by looking at this MRP","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788323150/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788358626","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104979#issuecomment-2788358626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104979","id":2788358626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mMvni","user":{"login":"Natahan-Tatan","id":88054177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDU0MTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88054177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan","html_url":"https://github.com/Natahan-Tatan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T05:57:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T06:05:32Z","body":"Hi @runzh-crypto @adriano-sudario \n\nThanks for your feedback.\n\nThis is strange, Godot doesn't freeze on version 4.4.1 🤔 \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b28c351-9018-4108-a03b-1c7af47d73d9\n\nBut yes when I test on 4.5-dev2 (from April 8th 2025)  Godot will freeze...\n\nBut in my code I just \n- Create a empty image and copy data from base image\n- Loop on all pixels and  replace the color by the picked one (excluded alpha to keep transparent pixels)\n- Replace texture image data by the new one\n\n<details>\n<summary>My code (to avoid MRP download)</summary>\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends ImageTexture\nvar _baseImage = load(\"res://person-walking.svg\")\n\nvar _color: Color = Color.WHITE\nvar _textureImage: ImageTexture\n\n@export var color: Color:\n\tget:\n\t\treturn _color\n\tset(value):\n\t\t_color = value\n\t\tupdateImage()\n\nfunc updateImage():\n\tprint(\"Update image\");\n\tvar image = Image.new()\n\timage.copy_from(_baseImage.get_image())\n\t\n\tfor x in image.get_width():\n\t\tfor y in image.get_height():\n\t\t\tvar originColor = image.get_pixel(x,y)\n\t\t\timage.set_pixel(x, y, Color(_color.r, _color.g, _color.b, originColor.a))\n\t\t\t\n\tset_image(image)\n```\n\n</details>\n\nI will do a last test on Godot 3 (because I originally began this project in Godot 3).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2788358626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790786453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104979#issuecomment-2790786453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104979","id":2790786453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mWAWV","user":{"login":"Natahan-Tatan","id":88054177,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4MDU0MTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88054177?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan","html_url":"https://github.com/Natahan-Tatan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Natahan-Tatan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T19:29:10Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T19:29:10Z","body":"Ok I remark I use [create_from_image](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/classes/class_imagetexture.html#class-imagetexture-method-create-from-image) to set the image of the `ImageTexture` in Godot 3.\n\nUnfortunately in Godot 4 this method is now static and returns a new `ImageTexture` so I can't use it anymore to regenerate the image in the texture itself.\n\nI solved my problem by applying my script to an AltasTexture and by assign the return of `create_from_image` to the `atlas` property and know it's work without focus issue.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6deab08-3660-4ddc-83c8-fcfeb427c89e","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2790786453/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]